## Commands

Before claiming any change done: `npm run lint && npm run typecheck && npm test` — all
three must pass.

## Layout

- `src/` — the library
- `research/specs/` — dated design specs
- `research/plans/` — implementation plans

## Primitives

- **Instructions** — this file, always in context.
- **Rules** — `src/lib/rules/`, one record per rule.
- **Skills** — `.claude/skills/`, how to judge and how to fix.
- **Schemas** — the token name contract and the component meta schema.

## Loops

- **BUILD**, on a component change: scaffold, then five co-located files, then the
  usage contract with its why, then the docs page from the same judgments.
- **AUDIT**, on merge: the detector, the rendered passes, the schema gates.
- **Human gate**: review approves judgment, not syntax. A rejection is not finished
  when the instance is fixed — encode it back into a rule so it cannot recur.
